# Trivy vulnerability ignore list
#
# Backend (Python / Starlette):
# These CVEs affect starlette < 1.3.1, but upgrading starlette requires
# upgrading FastAPI beyond 0.115.x (our pinned version). These are accepted
# risks tracked for future dependency updates.
#
# starlette: DoS via Range header merging (fixed in 0.49.1)
CVE-2025-62727

# starlette: SSRF via UNC paths in StaticFiles (fixed in 1.1.0)
CVE-2026-48818

# starlette: form() limits silently ignored — DoS (fixed in 1.3.1)
CVE-2026-54283

# Frontend (Alpine / Nginx base image packages):
# Base image pinned to nginx:1.27-alpine per assignment rubric G1.
# OS packages are updated via apk upgrade during docker build, and known
# upstream CVEs are tracked here as accepted risks.

